    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL\n| extend parsed = parse_json(Log_s)\n| extend level = coalesce(tostring(parsed.level), iff(Log_s contains 'ERROR', 'ERROR', iff(Log_s contains 'WARN', 'WARN', 'INFO')))\n| extend msg = coalesce(tostring(parsed.message), Log_s)\n| extend traceId = coalesce(tostring(parsed.traceId), tostring(parsed.correlationId), '')\n| where level in ('ERROR', 'WARN') or Log_s has_any ('Exception', 'OutOfMemoryError', '503', '502')\n| project TimeGenerated, Service = ContainerAppName_s, Level = level, TraceId = traceId, Message = substring(msg, 0, 260)\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\n| take 50",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "50 dòng Log ERROR / WARN / Exception gần nhất (Logstash JSON)",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "console-errors"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ContainerAppSystemLogs_CL\n| project TimeGenerated, Service = ContainerAppName_s, Revision = RevisionName_s, Reason = Reason_s, Event = Log_s\n| order by TimeGenerated desc\n| take 50",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "50 sự kiện hệ thống gần nhất (Scale 0↔1, KEDA, Pull Image, Restart/OOM)",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "system-events"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL\n| summarize LogLines = count() by Service = ContainerAppName_s, bin(TimeGenerated, 1h)\n| render timechart",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "Mật độ Log theo giờ (giúp phát hiện service bị poll/lặp bất thường)",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "timechart"
            },
            "name": "log-volume-chart"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "logs"
      },
      "name": "group-logs"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Theo dõi Credit Azure for Students ($100) & Hạn mức Miễn phí\n- **Xem số dư Credit $100 còn lại:** [Azure Education Hub](https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_Education/EducationMenuBlade/~/overview) hoặc [Azure Sponsorships Balance](https://www.microsoftazuresponsorships.com/Balance)\n- **Xem chi phí từng dịch vụ (`rg-smarttravel-b1`):** [Azure Cost Analysis](https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_CostManagement/Menu/~/costanalysis)\n- **Hạn mức miễn phí hàng tháng (ACA Consumption Free Grant):** `180,000 vCPU-s` (50 vCPU-giờ) · `360,000 GiB-s` (100 GiB-giờ) · `2,000,000 Requests`.\n- **Hạn mức Log Analytics:** Miễn phí `5 GB/tháng` (Daily Cap đã đặt `0.15 GB/ngày` ≈ `4.5 GB/tháng`, retention `30 ngày`)."
            },
            "name": "cost-links"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "Usage\n| where TimeGenerated >= startofmonth(now())\n| summarize IngestedMB = round(sum(Quantity), 2) by DataType, IsBillable\n| order by IngestedMB desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Dung lượng Log Analytics đã nạp từ đầu tháng (MB / 5,120 MB Free)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "law-usage"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL\n| where TimeGenerated >= startofmonth(now())\n| summarize ActiveMinutes = dcount(bin(TimeGenerated, 1m)) by Service = ContainerAppName_s\n| extend Est_vCPU_Seconds = ActiveMinutes * 60 * 0.25, Est_GiB_Seconds = ActiveMinutes * 60 * 0.5\n| order by ActiveMinutes desc",
              "size": 1,
              "title": "Ước tính thời gian thức (Active Minutes) từ đầu tháng theo Log (0.25 vCPU / 0.5 GiB)",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{Workspace}"
              ],
              "visualization": "table"
            },
            "name": "active-minutes-est"
          }
        ]
      },
      "conditionalVisibility": {
        "parameterName": "SelectedTab",
        "comparison": "isEqualTo",
        "value": "cost"
      },
      "name": "group-cost"
    }
  ],
